OL,3,AIran court upholds lashes sentence for
OL,4,Asinger who performed without hijab
OL,5,
OL,6,FIran's judiciary launched proceedings
OL,7,Fagainst the 29-year-old after the video
OL,8,Fwent viral, gaining millions of views,
OL,9,Fsaying the performance was "in
OL,10,Fviolation of the country's legal and
OL,11,Fcultural regulations".
OL,13,FIn June, a criminal court in Qom
OL,14,Freportedly found Ahmadi and eight
OL,15,Fmembers of her band and production team
OL,16,Fguilty of charges including "offending
OL,17,Fpublic decency" through the publication
OL,18,Fof "obscene and indecent material".
OL,23,APub: 28-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG2/2
